and is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
not the MIT license above.

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-codicons/blob/9d6c6e5f0714e82d5b33b1775969ab49d32d45c8/src/icons/word-wrap.svg
